":"not required","activity_note":"SERIOUS AVALANCHE COUNTRY, NO dedicated JAN bulletin: consult JAN (nadare.jp) regional Nagano info + JMA forecasts; backcountry GUIDED-ONLY via registered tours + gates, beacon/probe/shovel mandatory; tree-well/deep-snow immersion suffocation risk (never ski trees alone); high-altitude cold/wind/whiteout on Yokoteyama/Shibutoge; easy to get lost across the sprawling linked area","fcdo":{"posture":"1","quotes":[],"url":"https://www.gov.uk/foreign-travel-advice/japan","read":"2026-08-19","page_updated":"2026-08-19T15:40:39+01:00"}},"timing":{"peak":"Deep winter (Christmas/NY + Jan-Feb powder + prime snow-monkey season + Lunar New Year); busiest, min-stays at top hotels","shoulder":"Late Nov-mid Dec (early season) + long spring tail Apr-mid May incl Golden Week (high peaks)","green":"Mid-May-Oct national-park hiking, alpine flowers, autumn foliage (lowest rates)","booking_lead":"Christmas/NY + Jan + top hotels (Okushiga/Prince) 6-12 mo; regular winter 3-6 mo; shoulder/spring 1-3 mo (qualitative; verify)","off_season_specials":"Spring skiing high peaks (Apr-mid May); green-season hiking + foliage (Jun-Oct); midweek winter value","event_peaks":"Christmas/NY, Japanese New Year (Shogatsu), Lunar New Year, Australian/Asian school holidays, Golden Week spring tail; year-round snow monkeys peaking Dec-Feb","campaign_start":"Next winter + top hotels by prior spring/summer (6-12 mo); long spring + Golden Week from Jan; green-season national park from late winter"},"jewels":[{"name":"Ski ~18 resorts on one all-area pass","si_tag":"Winter/Ski","status":"live","tier":"comfort","price_band":"~JPY 9,000/day; multi-day cheaper/day (approx)","timing":"ski ~late Nov-mid May; powder heart Dec-Feb","draw_rank":1,"hook":"link nearly 50 lifts and ~80 km of runs across Japan''s largest connected ski area on a single ticket","si":"ski","blurb":"link nearly 50 lifts and ~80 km of runs across Japan''s largest connected ski area on a single ticket","when":"ski 